@bsp：谢谢指正，这里写反了。
arm gic驱动作为平台gic的父设备。

从下方示例中可以看到：gic是sysirq的parent

sysirq: sysirq@system {
    compatible = "xxx,XX-sysirq", "syscon";
    #interrupt-cells = <3>;
    interrupt-parent = <&gic>;
    interrupt-controller;
    ranges;
    services = <&tee_regmap>;
    irq-map = <48 2 0>, // GPIO
    <29 4 1>, // AON RTC
    <31 6 0>, // aon timer1
    <30 8 0>, // aon time0
    <9 10 0>, // eth0
    <33 18 0>, // canfd0
    <36 14 0>; // canfd1
    reg = <0x0 0x43060000 0x0 0x634>;
};
